 "entityTypes": {
  "kid": "{type:'kid', kind:'scooter'|'skateboard', x, y, range, harmless:true, hitbox:false, bonus:'hop'}: ambient NPC kid, HARMLESS (no damage, no knock-back, no collision); never inside a brawl zone.",
  "secret_paw": "{type:'secret_paw', id:'w1-<n>', x, y}: hidden golden-paw collectible (World 1 has 10: w1-1..w1-10 over silverdale_1..7); floats, no collision.",
  "arena.waves": "arenas[].waves = [{enemies:[{id, from:'left'|'right'|'sky'}]}, ...]: on lock spawn wave 1; when every enemy of a wave is down wait waveGap s, then spawn the next. from left/right = run in from just off-screen at that arena edge (x0-1 / x1+1, feet row y); sky = flyer swoops in from the top. enemies[] = wave 1 ids (fallback for the old engine). wallBounce: the camera-lock walls at x0/x1 act as bounce walls for wall-bounce combos."
 },
 "notes": "STYLE BRAWLER (hack and slash, like the Training Arena). Brawl zones are 30-36 tiles wide, flat, 14 open rows high (no ceilings / slabs) for launchers, air juggles, air combos and wall bounces with every form (4-tall Legendary / Awakened). Traversal set-pieces between them use climb (T), wall jump (lightwell <=3 wide), ledge grab (L, <=4 up) and drop-downs; no double jump needed, little plain jumping. Kids are harmless NPCs and never in a brawl zone. Paddy is the only cream cat with a dark mask (no siamese in World 1-1). Secret paws w1-1 (stair-tower sky) and w1-2 (puriri top). Entity y = feet cell; ground surface row 14."
}